exports[`formatReport — golden snapshots > renders blocker (balanced preset, no AI) — snapshot 1`] = `
"
File: blocker.instructions.md
Tool: copilot  Kind: scoped  Preset: balanced  Criteria: v0.1.0

 BLOCKER  Secrets in plain text
   line 17 — "ging key: AKIA************ ## Context The staging dash" — AWS access key id
 BLOCKER  Internal hosts and addresses
   line 21 — "lives at inte*********.local and is only reachable from the" — Internal hostname

Overall score: 40/100 — critical (capped from 90)

  Clarity & Precision  ████████████████████ 100 (3/5 checks)
  Structure & Format   ████████████████████ 100
  Completeness         ████████████████████ 100 (2/5 checks)
  Cost Efficiency      ████████████████████  98
  Security             ██████████░░░░░░░░░░  50

Fix list (by impact):
   1.  blocker  Remove the secret immediately, purge it from git history and rotate it. Reference an environment variable instead of the value.
   2.  blocker  Replace internal hostnames with placeholders — otherwise they reach the AI provider on every call.
   3. [info] Replace long code blocks with a minimal example or point to a file in the repo."
`;

exports[`formatReport — golden snapshots > renders good (balanced preset, no AI) — snapshot 1`] = `
"
File: example.instructions.md
Tool: copilot  Kind: scoped  Preset: balanced  Criteria: v0.1.0

Overall score: 77/100 — solid

  Clarity & Precision  ████████████████████ 100 (3/5 checks)
  Structure & Format   ████████████████████ 100
  Completeness         ███░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░  16 (2/5 checks)
  Cost Efficiency      ██████████████░░░░░░  70
  Security             ████████████████████ 100

Fix list (by impact):
   1. [info] Add at least one short example — ideally a contrasting pair (do this / not this).
   2. [info] Add a constraint on response length or shape (e.g. "changed code only, no explanation"). Output tokens cost a multiple of input tokens.
   3. [info] State what explicitly must NOT be done — prohibitions often carry more weight than permissions."
`;

